// Editing the program from the language (§7.4, author's decision 2026-10-17): the
// editing function changes the program itself through the base - as a human edit, with
// journal; Not on execution: only explicit application (tz apply, editor).
//
// program: program_edit.tz
run
// expect: 9 4
apply refactor
// expect: применена refactor: правок 2
fmt
// expect: square(x) => x * x;
// expect: a = square(3);
// expect: b = square(2);
// expect-not: print(debug);
run
// expect: 9 4
// expect-not: 7
roundtrip
// expect: roundtrip: совпадает
apply nothing
// expect: нет функции правки nothing() без параметров
